('p','The business question is the one every subscription service asks: **will this subscriber cancel in the next 30 days?** To answer it a model needs one table with one row per person, describing what they did recently and whether they actually cancelled. That table does not exist. It has to be built from two sources that live in different systems, owned by different teams, in different shapes.'),
