('p','One tool appears for each concept, at the moment the problem makes it necessary: Airflow for orchestration, Spark for distributed curation, Parquet for columnar storage, EzPresto for federation, RAPIDS cuDF for GPU acceleration, Kubeflow Notebooks as the workbench, XGBoost for the model, MLflow for the registry, and the CUDA-X libraries cuML and cuVS for accelerated modelling and vector search.'),

